limated beam of sodium atoms with a de Broglie wavelength of 16 pm and high-quality 0.4-μm-period free-standing gratings which we fabricated using a novel method. The interference signal is 70 counts/s, which allows us to determine the phase to 0.1 rad in 1 min. Applications of atom interferometers are briefly discussed.", "abstract_source_suggest": {"input": "APS"}}], "refereed": true, "titles": [{"title": "An interferometer for atoms"}], "external_system_identifiers": [{"schema": "SPIRES", "value": "SPIRES-7972962"}], "facet_author_name": ["2390509_David E. Pritchard", "2458745_Q.A. Turchette", "2548149_David W. Keith", "2548158_Christopher R. Ekstrom"], "_oai": {"sets": ["Literature"], "id": "oai:inspirehep.net:331914", "updated": "2023-03-09T19:31:27.351312"}, "curated": true, "journal_title_variants": ["Phys.Rev.Lett.", "Phys. Rev. Lett."]}, "created": "2008-09-22T00:00:00+00:00", "updated": "2023-03-09T19:31:27.351312+00:00"}], "total": 1}, "links": {"self": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1", "bibtex": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex", "latex-eu": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu", "latex-us": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1&format=latex-us", "json": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1&format=json", "json-expanded": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1&format=json-expanded", "cv": "https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=doi%3A10.1103%2Fphysrevlett.66.2693&size=5&page=1&format=cv"}}